~/.tmux.conf:5: note: hooks.session-created is replaced by a later set-hook at ~/.tmux.conf:6
~/.tmux.conf:6: note: hooks.session-created unset here (-u)
~/.tmux.conf:9: set-hook: not supported (session, window and pane hooks; grofe's hooks are global (set-hook -g)): set-hook after-kill-pane 'display gone'
~/.tmux.conf:10: set-hook: not supported (hook arrays; a hook holds one command in grofe): set-hook -g client-resized[1] 'display resized'
